    "title": "Tasha Launches Album With New Song Featuring L'Rain and Jamila Woods - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Jazz Monroe ,\n13 hours ago Tasha has a new album on the way. You Are Spring, the singer-songwriter’s follow-up to 2024’s All This and So Much More, is due June 26 via Bayonet. A pair of new songs accompany the announcement—one of which, “Spring,” features L’Rain and Jamila Woods. Listen to that and “Clarion” below. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
